  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5901.951 Student competency portfolios",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5901.951 “Student competency portfolios” means the process by which the educational training agency tracks and documents student achievement of the vital skill sets and cognitive learning for each level of initial training.\n\nSource. #13953, eff 4-30-24",
